  "foundationObject": "BlacksmithLV2_Foundation_Base",
  "foundationModelSize": [
    430,
    350,
    16
  ],
  "materialBrief": "棕灰砖墙、灰蓝金属坡顶、单座砖烟囱、黑铁机械与克制炉火。",
  "designBrief": "左侧装卸双门向内打开90度，露出有深度的门内空间；保留右炉膛、单烟囱与齿轮锤徽记；侧面长柄兵器架换为附墙蒸汽传动飞轮，前方铁砧位改为机械锻锤；桌子及台钳替换为材料箱、坯料、手工具与齿轮加工机。无现代感应炉、数控柜、第二厂房或电站设备。",
  "model": "tools/ai-gen/_industrial_support_buildings_20260831/steam_arsenal_industrial/steam_arsenal_industrial_model.blend",
  "approvalPreview": "tools/ai-gen/_industrial_support_buildings_20260831/steam_arsenal_industrial/steam_arsenal_industrial_model_approval_preview.png",
